{"title": "Githyanki vocabulary", "pageid": 17718, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Githyanki_vocabulary", "categories": ["Lore"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<table style=\"float:right;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Vlaakith_Icon_Original.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><img src=\"/w/images/9/91/Vlaakith_Icon_Original.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"196\" height=\"196\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Vlaakith_Icon_Original.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>\"Vlaakith\"<sup id=\"cite_ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> in githyanki tir'su<sup id=\"cite_ref-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></figcaption></figure>\n</td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: top;\"><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png/200px-Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png/300px-Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png/400px-Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png/200px-Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Githyanki_Tir%27su_Alphabet_WoT-HR.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption>The Githyanki<sup id=\"cite_ref-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> tir'su alphabet<sup id=\"cite_ref-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></figcaption></figure>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>A non-exhaustive list of <a href=\"/wiki/Githyanki\" title=\"Githyanki\">Gith</a> words and phrases that appear in the game.\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Vocabulary\">Vocabulary</span></h2>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r347748\">.mw-parser-output .div-col{margin-top:0.3em;column-width:20em}.mw-parser-output .div-col>ul{list-style-type:inherit}.mw-parser-output .div-col-rules{column-rule:1px solid #aaa}.mw-parser-output .div-col dl,.mw-parser-output .div-col ol,.mw-parser-output .div-col ul{margin-top:0}.mw-parser-output .div-col li,.mw-parser-output .div-col dd{page-break-inside:avoid;break-inside:avoid-column}</style><div class=\"div-col\" style=\"column-width: 28em; list-style-type: none;\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"B\"> B </span></h3> \n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Baht_t'[Name]\"></span>Baht t'[Name]</dt>\n<dd>Sister of <sup id=\"cite_ref-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>Chosen of<sup id=\"cite_ref-7\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"C\"> C </span></h3> \n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Chk\"></span>Chk</dt>\n<dd>Tsk (Interjection)<sup id=\"cite_ref-8\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Ch'k'l_ghaik_Vlaakith_m'_zath'ak!\"></span>Ch'k'l ghaik Vlaakith m' zath'ak!</dt>\n<dd>Mind flayer - abomination to Vlaakith!<sup id=\"cite_ref-9\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Ch'mar,_zal'a_Vlaakith.\"></span>Ch'mar, zal'a Vlaakith.</dt>\n<dd><a href=\"/wiki/Vlaakith\" title=\"Vlaakith\">Vlaakith's</a> will above all.<sup id=\"cite_ref-checkpoint_10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-checkpoint-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Ch'r'ai\"></span>Ch'r'ai</dt>\n<dd>Inquisitor.<sup id=\"cite_ref-chain_11-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-chain-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"chraith\"></span>chraith</dt>\n<dd>Enemy.<sup id=\"cite_ref-12\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-12\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>12<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"chraith'kan_zharn\"></span>chraith'kan zharn</dt>\n<dd>\"May your enemies know agony.\"<sup id=\"cite_ref-13\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-13\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>13<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>Closest Githyanki equivalent to \"thank you\"</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"F\"> F </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Fagh_wo'h_chox\"></span>Fagh wo'h chox</dt>\n<dd>Fuck off!<sup id=\"cite_ref-endundecided_14-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-endundecided-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"G\"> G </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"gh'ath\"></span>gh'ath</dt>\n<dd>Ship or nautiloid.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"gha'g_shkath_zai\"></span>gha'g shkath zai</dt>\n<dd>For the honour of.<sup id=\"cite_ref-follow_15-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-follow-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-vossambush_16-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-vossambush-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-17\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-17\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>17<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"ghaik\"></span>ghaik</dt>\n<dd>A <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind Flayer\">mind flayer</a>.<sup id=\"cite_ref-18\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-18\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>18<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"ghustil\"></span>ghustil</dt>\n<dd>Healer.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"gish\"></span>gish</dt>\n<dd>A military title, a warrior who mixes martial combat with arcane magic.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Gith'ka_tavki_krash'ht!\"></span>Gith'ka tavki krash'ht!</dt>\n<dd>Gith's light guides us!<sup id=\"cite_ref-vossambush_16-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-vossambush-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"githzerai\"></span>githzerai</dt>\n<dd>Those who spurn Gith; a <a href=\"/wiki/Githzerai\" title=\"Githzerai\">separate culture</a> split from the Githyanki long ago.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"g'lathk\"></span>g'lathk</dt>\n<dd>Lowest social class, social caste responsible for farming and labour.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"g'lyck\"></span>g'lyck</dt>\n<dd>Githyanki version of a sigh (Interjection)<sup id=\"cite_ref-19\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-19\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>19<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"H\"> H </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"hshar'lak\"></span>hshar'lak</dt>\n<dd>Traitor.<sup id=\"cite_ref-20\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-20\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>20<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"htak'a\"></span>htak'a</dt>\n<dd>A battle cry. Attack! (imperative)<sup id=\"cite_ref-checkpoint_10-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-checkpoint-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"hta'zith\"></span>hta'zith</dt>\n<dd>Die, creature! (imperative)<sup id=\"cite_ref-chain_11-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-chain-11\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>11<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"I\"> I </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"istark\"></span>istark</dt>\n<dd>Coward.<sup id=\"cite_ref-interrupted_21-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-interrupted-21\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"istik\"></span>istik</dt>\n<dd>Outsider</dd>\n<dd>Other</dd>\n<dd>Non-gith (slur)<sup id=\"cite_ref-22\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-22\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>22<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-23\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-23\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>23<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"J\"> J </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"jhe'stil\"></span>jhe'stil</dt>\n<dd>A superior (honorific)<sup id=\"cite_ref-trespassing_24-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-trespassing-24\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>24<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>Supreme (adjective)</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"jhe'stil_kith'rak\"></span>jhe'stil kith'rak</dt>\n<dd>Supreme Knight.<sup id=\"cite_ref-25\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-25\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>25<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"K\"> K </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"k'chakhi\"></span>k'chakhi</dt>\n<dd>Idiot<sup id=\"cite_ref-26\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-26\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>26<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"kaincha\"></span>kaincha</dt>\n<dd>Disgusting.<sup id=\"cite_ref-27\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-27\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>27<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"cite-bracket\" id=\"kainyank<sup_id=\"></span>kainyank<sup id=\"cite_ref-28\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-28\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>28<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dt>\n<dd>Cursed child<sup id=\"cite_ref-29\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-29\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>29<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>Gith curse word<sup id=\"cite_ref-30\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-30\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>30<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>Cursed one<sup id=\"cite_ref-endundecided_14-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-endundecided-14\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>14<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"kith'rak\"></span>kith'rak (singular), <span class=\"anchor\" id=\"kith'raki\"></span>kith'raki (plural) <sup id=\"cite_ref-31\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-31\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>31<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dt>\n<dd>Captain - A gith commander in charge of ten sarths (100 warriors total)<sup id=\"cite_ref-32\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-32\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>32<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>Knight<sup id=\"cite_ref-33\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-33\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>33<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"kiir'vrahc\"></span>kiir'vrahc</dt>\n<dd>Betrayer<sup id=\"cite_ref-dmag_34-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-dmag-34\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>34<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"M\"> M </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Mha_stil'na_forjun_inyeri\"></span>Mha stil'na forjun inyeri</dt>\n<dd>May the Comet blaze my path forward. <sup id=\"cite_ref-35\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-35\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>35<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"mla'ghir\"></span>mla'ghir</dt>\n<dd>Liberator.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"mlar\"></span>mlar</dt>\n<dd>A Gith term for crafter or artisan.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"P\"> P </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"pa'vrylk\"></span>pa'vrylk</dt>\n<dd>Stop! (imperative)<sup id=\"cite_ref-36\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-36\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>36<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"R\"> R </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"ra'stil\"></span>ra'stil</dt>\n<dd>Ally.<sup id=\"cite_ref-checkpoint_10-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-checkpoint-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"S\"> S </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Sarevok'cha_tsk'in'va\"></span>Sarevok'cha tsk'in'va</dt>\n<dd>\"<a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sarevok\">Sarevok</a> can eat shit.\" <sup id=\"cite_ref-37\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-37\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>37<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"sarth\"></span>sarth</dt>\n<dd>Githyanki general in charge of ten men<sup id=\"cite_ref-38\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-38\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>38<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"sa'varsh\"></span>sa'varsh</dt>\n<dd>Teacher</dd>\n<dd>Trainer</dd>\n<dd>Drill Sergeant<sup id=\"cite_ref-g5_39-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-g5-39\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>39<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-upguard_40-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-upguard-40\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>40<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Sha'vah\"></span>Sha'vah</dt>\n<dd>Hail <sup id=\"cite_ref-vossambush_16-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-vossambush-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Sha_va_zai\"></span>Sha va zai</dt>\n<dd>I love you<sup id=\"cite_ref-vossambush_16-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-vossambush-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"she'lak\"></span>she'lak</dt>\n<dd>Idealist do-gooder</dd>\n<dd>Benevolent burden<sup id=\"cite_ref-41\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-41\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>41<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"shka'keth\"></span>shka'keth</dt>\n<dd>Asshole (Derogatory). <sup id=\"cite_ref-trespassing_24-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-trespassing-24\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>24<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"shkath_zai\"></span>shkath zai</dt>\n<dd>For the honour!<sup id=\"cite_ref-42\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-42\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>42<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dd>For honour<sup id=\"cite_ref-trespassing_24-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-trespassing-24\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>24<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> (Greeting)</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"shu'kyani\"></span>shu'kyani</dt>\n<dd>The 'egg-layers.' Githyanki who only visit the Material Plane long enough to pass their eggs.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"ska'kek_kir_Gith_shabell'eth\"></span>ska'kek kir Gith shabell'eth</dt>\n<dd>Mother Gith compels you to listen. <sup id=\"cite_ref-43\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-43\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>43<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"T\"> T </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"tas'ki\"></span>tas'ki</dt>\n<dd>An expression of annoyance.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"tavki_na'zin\"></span>tavki na'zin</dt>\n<dd>Show us truth!<sup id=\"cite_ref-follow_15-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-follow-15\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>15<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-44\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-44\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>44<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"tsk'va\"></span>tsk'va</dt>\n<dd>Shit.<sup id=\"cite_ref-checkpoint_10-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-checkpoint-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"tir'su\"></span>tir'su</dt>\n<dd>The Githyanki alphabet.<sup id=\"cite_ref-45\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-45\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>45<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Tu'narath\"></span>Tu'narath</dt>\n<dd>\"The One in the Void\" \"The City of Death\" The githyanki capital city in the Astral Plane. Built upon the giant, long-dead remains of an ancient six-armed god.</dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"V\"> V </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Varsh\"></span>Varsh</dt>\n<dd>Caretaker of young Githyanki within a crèche.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Vlaakith\"></span>Vlaakith</dt>\n<dd>Death.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Vlaakith'ka_sivim_hrath_krash'ht\"></span>Vlaakith'ka sivim hrath krash'ht</dt>\n<dd>Only in Vlaakith may we find light.<sup id=\"cite_ref-teen_46-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-teen-46\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>46<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"vin'iisk\"></span>vin'iisk</dt>\n<dd>Underling.<sup id=\"cite_ref-upguard_40-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-upguard-40\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>40<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Y\"> Y </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"yank\"></span>yank</dt>\n<dd>Child, follower; plural <i>yanki</i>. Plural form is sometimes used as a shorthand for the Githyanki as a whole, Githyanki meaning \"children of Gith\".</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Yisk_Gith'ka_tavki_krash'ht!\"></span>Yisk Gith'ka tavki krash'ht!</dt>\n<dd>Mother Gith, reveal your light.<sup id=\"cite_ref-vossambush_16-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-vossambush-16\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>16<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd></dl>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Z\"> Z </span></h3>\n<dl><dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"Zai,_zai,_zai\"></span>Zai, zai, zai</dt>\n<dd>Battle cry of sorts, used to hype ones self up<sup id=\"cite_ref-47\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-47\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>47<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup id=\"cite_ref-48\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-48\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>48<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"[[zaith'isk]]\"></span><a href=\"/wiki/Zaith%27isk\" title=\"Zaith'isk\">zaith'isk</a></dt>\n<dd>\"Purifier,\" or more specifically, a device used to remove mind flayer parasites from infected Gith.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"zech\"></span>zech</dt>\n<dd>Wait! (imperative)<sup id=\"cite_ref-interrupted_21-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-interrupted-21\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>21<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"zhak_vo'n'ash_duj\"></span>zhak vo'n'ash duj</dt>\n<dd>\"Source of my bruises.\" Term of affection.</dd>\n<dt><span class=\"anchor\" id=\"zhak_vo'n'fynh_duj\"></span>zhak vo'n'fynh duj</dt>\n<dd>\"Source of my joy.\"</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_Links\">External Links</span></h2>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith_dictionary\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gith dictionary\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith_dictionary\">Gith dictionary</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></dd>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith_language\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Gith language\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Gith_language\">Gith language</a></span> on the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Main_Page\">Forgotten Realms Wiki</a></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\">References</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap mw-references-columns\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite_note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The final character is a ligature, hence the mismatch in letter number. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-2\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-2\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Larian appears to have chosen to write in all capital letters, denoted by the extension of the letter stems into the circle. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-3\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-3\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The Githzerai use a very similar alphabet, see: <a href=\"/wiki/File:Githzerai_Tir%27su_Alphabet_BoW-HR.png\" title=\"File:Githzerai Tir'su Alphabet BoW-HR.png\">Githzerai Tir'su</a>. The key distinction is that its direction and starting position are opposite that of the Githyanki form i.e. starting from the bottom, and read counterclockwise. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-4\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> The font used in the image is slightly different from Larian's, but the letters remain recognizable. </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-5\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CAMP_Laezel_VlaakithVisit_CFM_LaezelAvatar </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Laezel_InParty2_Nested_DefaultQuestionBank </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-7\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-7\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> There has only ever been one Baht t'Vlaakith<sup id=\"cite_ref-6\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup> </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-8\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-8\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> SHA_OrthonLair_PAD_EnteredLair </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-9\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-9\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CAMP_Daisy1_CRD_Laezel_BeforeDream </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-checkpoint-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-checkpoint_10-0\">10.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-checkpoint_10-1\">10.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-checkpoint_10-2\">10.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-checkpoint_10-3\">10.3</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_Hatchery_Caretaker </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-chain-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-chain_11-0\">11.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-chain_11-1\">11.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_ChainOfCommand_Templar </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-12\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-12\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_SecondTurn </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-13\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-13\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> LOW_Laezel_WRD_SavedFromOrin </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-endundecided-14\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-endundecided_14-0\">14.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-endundecided_14-1\">14.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> END_IllithidOptions_GD_Undecided </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-follow-15\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-follow_15-0\">15.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-follow_15-1\">15.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> phrase follows the subject </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-vossambush-16\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-vossambush_16-0\">16.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-vossambush_16-1\">16.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-vossambush_16-2\">16.2</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-vossambush_16-3\">16.3</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-vossambush_16-4\">16.4</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> END_VossEncounter_VossAmbush </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-17\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-17\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_PortraitKid </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-18\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-18\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> TUT_Helm_AltGuide_BeforeHelm </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-19\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-19\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Laezel_InParty2_Nested_DefaultQuestionBank </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-20\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-20\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_Hatchery_Caretaker </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-interrupted-21\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-interrupted_21-0\">21.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-interrupted_21-1\">21.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_CultistsSceneInterrupted </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-22\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-22\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_CrecheGuard01 </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-23\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-23\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_ChainOfCommand_AD_EscortingCultistsChatter </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-trespassing-24\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-trespassing_24-0\">24.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-trespassing_24-1\">24.1</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-trespassing_24-2\">24.2</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_UpperGuards_MainCheckpointTrespassing </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-25\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-25\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CAMP_Laezel_VossCampConfrontation_SCO_LaezelAvatar </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-26\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-26\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_General_MageHandMain </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-27\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-27\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_Quartermistress </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-28\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-28\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> composite of kain (likely common root with kaincha - disgusting) and yank - child </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-29\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-29\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CAMP_OrinAbduction_CFM_Laezel </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-30\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-30\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> TUT_Helm_LaezelBeforeHelm </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-31\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-31\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> END_GameFinale_AvatarLaezelFinalChoice </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-32\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-32\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> PLA_GithChokepoint_AD_SearchingCorpses </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-33\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-33\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CAMP_Laezel_SD_AfterCrecheReflection </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-dmag-34\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-dmag_34-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Dungeon Magazine Vol. XVII, No.4 Issue 100, page 104. Published in July 2003 </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-35\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-35\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CAMP_Laezel_WRD_AfterVlaakithVisit </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-36\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-36\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> HAG_Hag_AD_ControlledByMask </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-37\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-37\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">It is unclear which parts of the phrase have which functions. \"Sarevok\" is obvious. tsk'in'va is particularly interesting as tsk'va on its own means \"shit\" making 'in' an infix, presumably a verb equivalent to either \"eat,\" the auxiliary \"can,\" or a compound of both (in which case 'cha modifies only Sarevok as some form of declension or simple derision of the subject). The suffix 'cha bears resemblance to k'chakhi meaning idiot, lending some credence to the notion that it modifies Sarevok to convey a negative opinion of him. Unfortunately the only other example of the k' prefix is in Crèche K'liir and there are no other examples of the suffix khi, leaving little clue to what role 'cha plays in k'chakhi, or if it is even an independent morpheme in the first place.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-38\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-38\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> SCL_GithCreche_GithExplorer_Dead </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-g5-39\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-g5_39-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_CrecheGuard05 </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-upguard-40\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">↑ <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-upguard_40-0\">40.0</a></sup> <sup><a href=\"#cite_ref-upguard_40-1\">40.1</a></sup></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_UpperGuards_AD_MainCheckpointChatter </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-41\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-41\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Laezel_InParty2_Nested_TopicalGreetings </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-42\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-42\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_ChainOfCommand_Vlaakith_OM_Laezel_COM </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-43\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-43\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Said by Kith'rak Voss to the party at camp after laying down his sword so that they will listen and not attack.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-44\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-44\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> UND_AdamantineGolem_PAD_Victory </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-45\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-45\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> PLA_GithChokepoint_ReadingMap </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-teen-46\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-teen_46-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> CRE_CrecheTeenager01 </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-47\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-47\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> May be related to shkath zai </span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-48\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-48\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"> Laezel_InPartyEND </span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202726\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.113 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.120 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2761/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20105/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4805/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 16/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 1/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 21919/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 943426/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   83.587      1 -total\n 44.59%   37.268     61 Template:Vocab\n 39.89%   33.344     61 Template:Anchor\n 32.87%   27.473     60 Template:Ref\n  8.60%    7.185      1 Template:Div_col\n  6.86%    5.737      2 Template:FRWiki\n  6.21%    5.195      2 Template:Icon_link\n  5.75%    4.810      2 Template:Icon_text\n  4.11%    3.437      1 Template:PageSeo\n  4.10%    3.425      4 Template:Trim\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17718-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202726 and revision id 393657. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}